  "not_bundled": [
    "demos/01..04, 09, 20, 22 (flat vector, line art, isometric, 3D render, Bauhaus, pixel, HUD): FrameMotion already has engines for these looks; their methods go into those engines (pack 1, part 2), their prompts are kept in upstream/prompts/",
    "demos/06-collage, 18-hanazi, 19-paperclip: built on photos whose source and licence the repository does not record (its CREDITS.md is missing); left out until they run on the user's own photos",
    "videos/, docs/, site/, index.html, the README files and the WeChat images: films, previews and the showcase page",
    "harness/: upstream renderer (Puppeteer with a fixed Chrome path); FrameMotion's renderer replaces it",
    "lib/audio/ and its 56 MB of VCSL samples (CC0): the films render silent in FrameMotion; sound follows FrameMotion's own sound workflow",
    "assets/hdri, assets/images, the other textures (not used by the bundled films), assets/textures/grain (source not recorded; replaced by FrameMotion's own textures/grain_fine_2048.png from tools/make_grain.py)",
    "demos/*/out/ except 12-aurora-glass/out/env.json (render output; env.json is read by the film)"
  ],
